@sso = http://localhost:9080
@clientId = app-a
@clientSecret = replace-with-plaintext-used-to-create-configured-hash
@redirectUri = http://localhost:8081/callback

### 健康检查
GET {{sso}}/health

### 发起授权；浏览器应被跳转到登录页面
GET {{sso}}/authorize?client_id={{clientId}}&redirect_uri={{redirectUri}}&state=replace-with-random-state

### 登录
# 从登录页面复制 transaction_id 和 csrf_token。
POST {{sso}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

transaction_id=replace-me&csrf_token=replace-me&username=alice&password=replace-me

### 后端兑换一次性 Code
POST {{sso}}/token/exchange
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

code=replace-me&client_id={{clientId}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}&redirect_uri={{redirectUri}}

### 重复兑换相同 Code，预期返回 401 invalid_code
POST {{sso}}/token/exchange
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

code=replace-me&client_id={{clientId}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}&redirect_uri={{redirectUri}}

### 非法回调地址，预期返回 400 且不得产生 Location 到攻击者地址
GET {{sso}}/authorize?client_id={{clientId}}&redirect_uri=https://attacker.example/callback&state=test

### 退出中央 Session
POST {{sso}}/logout
